<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was slow in the Panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers were not well tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 400 slaughter steers and 200 heifers; following weekly movement of 113,500.</p>
<p>Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Steers -  Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1250 lbs 62.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - Select, few Choice 2-3 1050-1150 lbs 61.00-61.50.</p>
<p>Confirmed - 600   Last Week - None    Year Ago - 100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
